+## Deploy
+
+`bun run build` writes the static site to `target/`. To host it on Wasmer Edge, [import the repository on Wasmer](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=alxshelepenok%2Flumen). The link imports this public repository for a build and does not copy it into your GitHub account, so import your own fork or copy instead if you want to customize the blog and redeploy on push.
